{'symbol': 'CMG', 'date': '2022-06-02 08:07:00', 'title': 'CHIPOTLE RETURNS TO THE BASKETBALL POSTSEASON, WILL HIDE UP TO 50,000 BOGOS IN ITS TV ADS', 'text': "CHIPOTLE REWARDS MEMBERS HAVE A CHANCE TO SCORE BUY-ONE-GET-ONE (BOGO) OFFERS WHILE WATCHING THE 2022 MEN'S PROFESSIONAL BASKETBALL CHAMPIONSHIP SERIES NEWPORT BEACH, CALIF. , JUNE 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CHIPOTLE MEXICAN GRILL (NYSE: CMG) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT IS RETURNING TO THE MEN'S PROFESSIONAL BASKETBALL CHAMPIONSHIP SERIES TO HIDE UP TO 50,000 BUY-ONE-GET-ONE (BOGO) DEALS IN ITS TV ADS."}